If you’re trying to make characters talk (like for films, skits, or YouTube), you want apps that go beyond basic robotic reading and give you different voices, emotions, and export options.

Here are some of the best free Android text → AI voice apps (ranked for character/voice acting use 👇)

🎭 Best for realistic character voices
Speechify
200+ AI voices, including expressive & celebrity-style voices
Lets you tweak speed, tone, etc.
Good for narration + semi-acting
❗ Free version is limited (premium unlocks the best voices)
👉 Good if you want clean narration + some personality

ElevenLabs Reader
Extremely realistic voices (some of the best in AI right now)
Supports multiple languages + expressive tones
Free tier available
👉 Best choice if you want movie-level voice acting vibes

🎬 Best for creating character dialogue (fun / animated)
Narrator's Voice
Tons of voice styles + effects
Can export audio (MP3) for videos
Includes goofy / exaggerated voices
👉 Great for cartoon characters, memes, comedy skits

Voice Aloud Reader
Reads text, web pages, scripts
Saves audio files
Uses your phone’s TTS engine
👉 More basic, but useful for script reading + prototyping dialogue

🎥 Hidden gem (not just TTS)
CapCut
Built-in text-to-speech with character-style voices
Syncs voices directly to video
Free
👉 This is actually 🔥 for movies because:

You can assign different voices to different characters
Easy timeline editing
(Reddit users specifically recommend it for character voices and shorts)

🌐 Free browser-based (works on Android too)
FakeYou
Thousands of character voices (cartoon, celeb-style)
Totally free
Works in mobile browser
👉 Best for crazy character voices / impressions

⚙️ Simple & lightweight options
Speech Central
AI voices + file support (PDF, docs, etc.)
Good customization
Text to Speech 2026
Very basic but fast
Saves audio clips easily
👉 These are better for utility, not acting

🧠 What actually matters for “movie characters”
When picking one, focus on:

Voice variety (male/female/cartoon/emotional)
Emotion control (VERY important for acting)
Export audio files
Multi-character workflow (like CapCut)
🔥 My honest recommendation
If your goal is movie-style characters talking:

🥇 Best combo:
👉 ElevenLabs + CapCut
(generate voices → edit scenes)

🥈 Budget/free only:
👉 CapCut alone (surprisingly powerful)

🥉 Fun/cartoon style:
👉 Narrator’s Voice or FakeYou

